# LED dim, on the scripts page of the instr selector.
# A .ui entry is not run as a program: Nebulae itself handles it (ui.py,
# mode = the name after the number, here "led_dim").
# Speed click on it: all LEDs light up and the speed encoder sets how bright
# every LED is (0 = off .. 1 = full). Speed (or pitch) click goes back to the
# instrument that is playing; the value is saved by configsettings.py
# (Code/config/configsettings.txt).
